          "secNumber": "5.3",
          "heading": "Five lessons with evidence notebooks",
          "content": "Each lesson joins a physical principle, an observable, a competing explanation, and a quantified classroom calculation. A numerical result is conditional on the stated synthetic inputs. Details such as local hazard probability, legal extraction requirements or physical-property inversion cannot be derived from the simple cases.",
